# Mobile First Security

Persona AI should provide the same security experience on desktop and mobile.

Security features should be designed mobile-first.

Support:

• Phone call detection
• WhatsApp call detection
• Biometric authentication
• Mobile Authenticator
• Context-Bound OTP
• Push notifications

Whenever possible, demonstrate security features using realistic mobile workflows instead of desktop-only simulations.
